<title>PERU: PERU GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>PERU GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>PERU GOVERNMENT LIST (960913)</p>
<p>President (Sworn in 28 Jul 95 for a second</p>
<p>	5-year term)............................Alberto FUJIMORI</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p>GOVERNMENT (Formed 3 Apr 96)</p>
<p> Prime Minister........................Alberto PANDOLFI Arbulu</p>
<p>(Also Minister of Fisheries)</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Agriculture........................Rodolfo MUNANTE Sanguineti</p>
<p> Defence...................................Tomas CASTILLO Meza</p>
